Oldrunner is a text-mode remake of the Loadrunner game from Broderbund. This
version comes with 150 levels of its own, made for the Asciiverse (see
levels/oldrunner.lvl and tools/mklevels.py). See the manpage for more
information.

INSTALL
  To compile oldrunner, first run the configure script and then compile the 
  game using 'gmake' or 'make' depending on your system.

LICENSE
  The game and its levels are released under the BSD License.

THANKS
  Thanks go to:

  * Nicholas Marriott for the tmux configuration script which greatly inspired
    the configure script distributed with oldrunner.


